== Effects ==
* Teleports Isaac to a random room upon picking up a [[coin]].
* {{dlc|r+}} The type of the coin picked up affects the teleport destination:
** {{e|Penny}}: 50% chance for an unexplored combat room.
** {{e|Double Penny}}: 50% chance for {{r|Dice Room}}, {{r|Vault}}, {{r|Clean Bedroom}} or {{r|Dirty Bedroom}}.
** {{e|Nickel}}: 50% chance for {{r|Treasure Room}}, {{r|Shop}}, {{r|Library}}, {{r|Arcade}}, {{r|Challenge Room}} or {{r|Boss Challenge Room}}.
** {{e|Dime}}: 25% chance for {{r|Angel Room}} or {{r|Devil Room}}. This ignores Isaac's current devil/angel deal chances and picks at random.
** {{e|Lucky Penny}}: 50% chance for {{r|Secret Room}} or {{r|Super Secret Room}}.
** {{e|Golden Penny}}: 10% chance for {{r|I AM ERROR}} room.
** {{e|Sticky Nickel}}: 100% chance for {{r|Boss Room}} or {{r|Curse Room}}. This is only for the still-stuck version and the coin is still not actually picked up.

== Notes ==
* The effect can teleport Isaac to any room aside from an undiscovered {{r|Ultra Secret Room}}.
* {{dlc|r+}} The trinket has a small chance to teleport Isaac to {{r|Black Market}} if the {{r|I AM ERROR}} room should have been the target. In this case, there will be no door exiting back to a {{r|Crawl Space}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{I|Mom's Box|r+}}: The odds for landing in a special room are increased.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Black Candle}}: Prevents the teleport effect from triggering for all coins except the still-stuck {{e|Sticky Nickel}}.
* {{dlc|nr+}}{{A|Golden Trinket|n}} / {{i|Mom's Box|n}}: No effect.

